# Tarteel MCP Server Docs [​](https://mcp.tarteel.ai/docs/\#tarteel-mcp-server-docs)

Use Tarteel Quran tools in Claude, Gemini, and OpenAI clients.

## Start Here [​](https://mcp.tarteel.ai/docs/\#start-here)

One-click install:

- **ChatGPT** — [Install from the ChatGPT Apps directory](https://chatgpt.com/apps/tarteel/asdk_app_694ede64ff608191b4ae858c9f75f100)
- **Claude (Web/Desktop)** — [Add Tarteel as a custom connector](https://claude.ai/customize/connectors?modal=add-custom-connector&connectorName=Tarteel&connectorUrl=https://mcp.tarteel.ai/mcp)

For any other MCP client:

1. Open the [Quick Start guide](https://mcp.tarteel.ai/docs/quick-start.html).
2. Add this server URL in your app: `https://mcp.tarteel.ai/mcp`.
3. Enable Tarteel tools and start querying Quran content.
4. If you want to know more about the tools check [Tool Index](https://mcp.tarteel.ai/docs/tools/).

